55
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,480
You ruined me.

56
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,680
Why did you push me?

57
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,200
Why did you push me?

58
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,600
Why did you have to push me?

59
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,760
You all forced me.

60
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,600
What did I do wrong?

61
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,540
It's all your fault...

62
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:06,840
It's all your fault...

63
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,200
It's all your fault...

64
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,090
Don't worry.

65
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:29,240
It's just a minor surgery.

66
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,840
It's not life-threatening.

67
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,730
Don't be afraid.

68
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:34,560
I'll be waiting right here for you.

69
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:35,640
Thank you, He Yu.

70
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,600
I want to hear

71
